  </p>

  <p class="note-line">
    <strong>Build a high-income skill portfolio around the crossover, not just the stream label.</strong> A PCMB base becomes worth the extra two years of workload when you pair it with tools, real project proof, and communication skill — not when you simply hold the eligibility and hope a good option finds you later.
